{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.BsymLinearChain","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.BsymLinearChain","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":16,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.BsymLinearChain.Bsym_deuteron","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.BsymLinearChain.Bsym_deuteron","kind":"theorem","line":112,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BsymLinearChain.lean#L112-L116","doc":"The deuteron (`Z = N = 1`) is exactly the single p-n bond: `B_sym = α·L_pn`\n(the `B_sym(²H) = b_pn = 3.890 MeV` row of the audit, structurally). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.BsymLinearChain.Bsym_closed_form","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.BsymLinearChain.Bsym_closed_form","kind":"theorem","line":104,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BsymLinearChain.lean#L104-L110","doc":"**B_sym closed form.** `B_sym = α·[(Z−1)·L_pp + L_pn + (N−1)·L_nn]` — the\n#2343 linear-chain additivity, now a theorem (given the per-bond factorization\nencoded in `Bsym`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.BsymLinearChain.Bsym","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.BsymLinearChain.Bsym","kind":"def","line":100,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BsymLinearChain.lean#L100-L102","doc":"`B_sym` as the bond-weighted log-binding of the linear chain. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.BsymLinearChain.chain_binding_sum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.BsymLinearChain.chain_binding_sum","kind":"theorem","line":89,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BsymLinearChain.lean#L89-L98","doc":"**Additivity (the structural identity).** Summing an abstract per-bond energy\n`L : Bond → R` over the chain's bond list gives the additive closed form\n`(Z−1)·L_pp + L_pn + (N−1)·L_nn`. This is the log-binding factorization made\nalgebraic; it holds for all `Z, N` (with `ℕ`-`smul` coefficients). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.BsymLinearChain.chain_count_nn","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.BsymLinearChain.chain_count_nn","kind":"theorem","line":83,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BsymLinearChain.lean#L83-L85","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.BsymLinearChain.chain_count_pn","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.BsymLinearChain.chain_count_pn","kind":"theorem","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BsymLinearChain.lean#L79-L81","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.BsymLinearChain.chain_count_pp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.BsymLinearChain.chain_count_pp","kind":"theorem","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BsymLinearChain.lean#L74-L77","doc":"Per-type bond counts: `(Z−1)` p-p, `1` p-n, `(N−1)` n-n. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.BsymLinearChain.chain_num_bonds","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.BsymLinearChain.chain_num_bonds","kind":"theorem","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BsymLinearChain.lean#L66-L72","doc":"**Bond-count total.** For `Z, N ≥ 1` the chain has exactly `A − 1 = Z + N − 1`\nbonds — the `(Z−1) + 1 + (N−1)` decomposition. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.BsymLinearChain.chainBonds","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.BsymLinearChain.chainBonds","kind":"def","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BsymLinearChain.lean#L59-L64","doc":"The ordered bond list of the linear chain `p^Z n^N`: `(Z−1)` adjacent p-p\nbonds, the single p-n interface, then `(N−1)` adjacent n-n bonds. (`ℕ`\nsubtraction; the intended regime is `Z ≥ 1`, `N ≥ 1`, where the interface bond is\ngenuinely present.) ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.BsymLinearChain.instReprBond","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.BsymLinearChain.instReprBond","kind":"instance","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BsymLinearChain.lean#L57-L57","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.BsymLinearChain.instReprBond.repr","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.BsymLinearChain.instReprBond.repr","kind":"def","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BsymLinearChain.lean#L57-L57","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.BsymLinearChain.instDecidableEqBond","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.BsymLinearChain.instDecidableEqBond","kind":"instance","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BsymLinearChain.lean#L57-L57","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.BsymLinearChain.Bond.nn","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.BsymLinearChain.Bond.nn","kind":"ctor","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BsymLinearChain.lean#L56-L56","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.BsymLinearChain.Bond.pn","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.BsymLinearChain.Bond.pn","kind":"ctor","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BsymLinearChain.lean#L55-L55","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.BsymLinearChain.Bond.pp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.BsymLinearChain.Bond.pp","kind":"ctor","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BsymLinearChain.lean#L54-L54","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.BsymLinearChain.Bond","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.BsymLinearChain.Bond","kind":"inductive","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BsymLinearChain.lean#L52-L57","doc":"The three inter-nucleon bond types of the chain. ","signatureChunk":0}]}